{%- comment -%}
  Written out as literal blocks rather than looped over a delimited string:
  the client edits these in the theme editor, and a flat pipe-split list is
  both unreadable there and awkward in Liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="sec" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-head__pre">frequently asked</span>
      <h1 class="sec-head__main">Questions</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="acc" data-acc-single>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">How long before I see results?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Ayurvedic and nutraceutical formulas are cumulative rather than immediate. Most of our
          products are intended to be taken consistently for at least three months, alongside a
          balanced diet and regular activity. Individual responses vary.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Can I take more than one Helbrede product together?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Often yes — that is what the <a href="/pages/ritual-builder">Ritual Builder</a> is for.
          But combinations still need care, particularly if you take prescription medicines. Use the
          safety check on each product page, and call our consultants if you are unsure.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Are these medicines?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          No. They are nutraceutical and Ayurvedic proprietary formulations, labelled “not for
          medicinal use”. They are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Why do some ingredients say “not declared”?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Because the quantity is not stated on that product’s label. We would rather show you the
          gap than invent a number. Where a dose is declared, it appears exactly as printed on the pack.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Where are the products made?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          At a GMP-certified facility — Kenko Healthcare, Panchkula, Haryana. They are marketed by
          Helbrede Healthcare Ltd, and both names are printed on every pack.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Do you ship across India?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Yes. Enter your pincode on any product page for an estimated delivery date. Cash on
          delivery is available on most pincodes, and delivery is free above
          {{ settings.free_ship_threshold | money }}.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Can I return a product?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Unopened products can be returned within the window set out in our shipping and returns
          policy. Opened supplements cannot be returned for hygiene reasons — please call us and we
          will work it out.
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc__item">
        <button class="acc__btn" aria-expanded="false">Is the consultation really free?<span class="acc__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="acc__panel" style="height:0"><div class="acc__panel-in">
          Yes, and there is no obligation to buy. Our consultants are allowed to tell you that you
          do not need a supplement.
        </div></div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="note note--warn" style="margin-top:2rem">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 17 %}
      <span>Still stuck? Call {{ settings.phone }} between {{ settings.call_hours }}, or
      <a href="/pages/consultancy">book a free consultation</a>.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
